Suggests: gifski, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly, gstreamer1.0-pipewire
Description: Simple screen recorder for GIF, APNG, WebM and MP4
 Peeksmith records a selected screen area using a small movable window.
 It supports X11 and GNOME Shell Wayland sessions through XWayland,
 configurable frame rates, scaling, and optional high-quality GIF encoding.
